[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20041.03, "timestamp": "05:34:01", "text": "これは一体何だ？ ああ、その違いは大きい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20047.35, "timestamp": "05:34:07", "text": "。 ええと、違いは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20050.07, "timestamp": "05:34:10", "text": "持久力がないということです。 例えば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20053.03, "timestamp": "05:34:13", "text": "原神をプレイしたことがある人なら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20055.59, "timestamp": "05:34:15", "text": "スタミナみたいなものがあるのを知ってるよね？ えっと、名前を忘れちゃったんだけど、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20063.526, "timestamp": "05:34:23", "text": "1時間に10個か何かもらえるやつ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20065.11, "timestamp": "05:34:25", "text": "[鼻を鳴らす] つまり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20069.03, "timestamp": "05:34:29", "text": "ダンジョンをやったり、何かをしたり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20075.43, "timestamp": "05:34:35", "text": "アーティファクトなどを集めたりする場合、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20077.59, "timestamp": "05:34:37", "text": "スタミナみたいなものがあるんですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20080.548, "timestamp": "05:34:40", "text": "1日にできる回数には限りがありますよね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20082.628, "timestamp": "05:34:42", "text": "？ しかし、このゲームには"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20084.548, "timestamp": "05:34:44", "text": "スタミナという概念はない。   ああ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20086.708, "timestamp": "05:34:46", "text": "、全くスタミナがないんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20090.628, "timestamp": "05:34:50", "text": "好きなだけ時間をかけて、ひたすら作業をしたり、農作業をしたりできます。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20093.722, "timestamp": "05:34:53", "author": "@FEROCIOUS_Grrr", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/b2fcSyaRaGAEUJaW8yBs5ibxfiDi-brp1G8cHHTYAXKaRusaeuWU68kOjIUNWz1gmVNNSGP5MQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i have literally Zero exp in these kinda games 😅"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20094.31, "timestamp": "05:34:54", "text": "友達と一緒に続けてもいいし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20095.75, "timestamp": "05:34:55", "text": "、うん、わかったよね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20097.67, "timestamp": "05:34:57", "text": "？"}, {"